"     disk=/dev/userd0\n"
"          max-partitions=15\n"
msgstr ""
"     disk=/dev/userd0\n"
"          max-partitions=15\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"In cases where there is no kernel partition information available, such as "
"on loopback devices, the 'disk=' specification may include paritition start "
"information; viz.,"
